block -1076.28 -153.754 30 0 0 0 0 1000 0
> \text An infinite canvas for exploring mathematics through programming. Behind every piece of LaTeX here there is some compileable GLSL: the LaTeX is what you read, the shader is what runs.
end
block -1076.28 76.8768 24 0 0 1 0 1000 0
> \text Press right to go through the deck. Everything on a slide is an ordinary window of the canvas -- carry it by its rim, resize it with the wheel, drop it on the cross at the foot of the screen to throw it away.
end
