block 768.768 -269.069 26 0 0 0 0 470 0
> \text A box gets one number line, carrying all of its reals on one scale. A ring is yours to drag; a filled dot is derived, so move its inputs instead. Colour says which variable, shape says whether it moves.
end
block 768.768 -0 22 0 0 1 0 470 0
> \text a has been pulled out onto an axis of its own: highlight any mention of a variable in the code and drag it out of the box. Press the bare part of an axis to make a new one there.
end
