block 1460.66 -230.63 22 0 0 0 0 1000 0
> \text A function is a GLSL function, so a curve is evaluated per pixel rather than joined up between samples -- and a knob reshapes one at display rate. All three curves share one plot: drop a plot onto another and they merge.
end
