block 4535.73 -230.63 24 0 0 0 0 470 0
> \text The algebra is generated rather than included: concrete structs and concrete products, fully unrolled, no templates and no runtime dispatch. A type is a set of grades, so every product has an exact result type and every result type has a name.
end
block 4535.73 76.8768 22 0 0 1 0 470 0
> \text P and Q are points of 3D projective GA and R is a point between them, so joining P to R gives the line through both -- and dragging k grows that line's weight.
end
