block 5227.62 115.315 23.9314 0 0 0 0 997.145 0
> \text Neither is mathematics, so neither lives in types/ -- but both are windows: carried by the rim, landing on the grid, caught by the lasso, resized by the wheel. A corner crops. There is no decoder here; the frames come off an ffmpeg pipe as they arrive.
end
block 5227.62 307.507 22 0 0 1 0 1000 0
> \text The clip is trimmed to the second and a half between the markers, and plays round in a loop. Double-click a time to type an exact one.
end
